# Build context exclusions for the cloud images (PM-013, SCR-170 §4).
#
# Two jobs:
#   1. keep the context small, so a build does not ship build output or history
#   2. keep every secret-shaped file out of the context, so no layer, cache entry
#      or build argument can ever carry one (CLAUDE.md, D70, D78)
#
# Credentials reach a container only as files mounted from deploy.credentialFilesDir
# at run time. Nothing here is a substitute for that rule; this file is the second
# fence behind it.

# History and installed dependencies (each image installs its own from the lockfile).
.git
.gitmodules
node_modules
**/node_modules

# Contract build output.
contracts/out
contracts/cache
contracts/broadcast

# Secret-shaped paths. The first four come from the PM-013 scope; the rest are the
# remaining patterns scripts/check-no-secret-files.mjs refuses, so the two lists agree.
deployments/local-keys.json
env/*.local.*
.env*
**/.env*
*.key
**/*.key
*.key.json
**/*.key.json
*.pem
**/*.pem
*.p12
**/*.p12
keystore
**/keystore
*.keystore
**/*.keystore

# Internal notes, generated reports and run logs.
docs-internal
reports
.czar-run-logs

# Local build and test output that must never reach an image.
**/.next
**/.ponder
coverage
**/coverage
playwright-report
**/playwright-report
test-results
**/test-results
**/e2e-results
**/*.tsbuildinfo
